%div{ id: "skill_equipment_selection_content" }
  %h4.fw-semibold.mb-2 Describe what you can do
  %p.text-muted Your occupations already describe their core duties. Add specialties beyond those duties and select the equipment or software families you have used. Tool experience is separate from your occupation and does not imply ownership.
  = categories
  %h5.fw-semibold.mt-4 Specific experience (optional)
  %p.text-muted Add techniques, services, products or models in your own words. These add detail and can match jobs that explicitly ask for them; they do not automatically select categories.
  %p.text-muted.small One entry per line, up to 30 entries in each field. Common names help employers find your experience. These are self-reported details, not verified qualifications.
  .row.g-4
    - entry_fields.each do |field|
      .col-md-6
        = label_tag "profile_#{field[:attribute]}", field[:label], class: "form-label fw-semibold"
        = text_area_tag "profile[#{field[:attribute]}]", field[:value], id: "profile_#{field[:attribute]}", rows: 6, maxlength: ExperienceTerms::MAX_TEXT_LENGTH, placeholder: field[:placeholder], class: "form-control", aria: { describedby: "#{field[:attribute]}_errors" }
        %div.text-danger.small{ id: "#{field[:attribute]}_errors" }
          - profile.errors.full_messages_for(field[:attribute]).each do |message|
            %p.mb-0= message
  .mt-4
    = label_tag :profile_work_examples, "Specialties & experience examples (optional)", class: "form-label fw-semibold"
    = text_area_tag "profile[work_examples]", profile.work_examples, id: "profile_work_examples", class: "form-control", rows: 4, maxlength: 2000, aria: { describedby: "work_examples_help" }
    %p.form-text{ id: "work_examples_help" } Describe projects, responsibilities and the settings you have worked in. Employers can read this context alongside your occupations and experience entries.
    - profile.errors.full_messages_for(:work_examples).each do |message|
      %p.text-danger.small= message

- if show_navigation
  .row.mt-3
    .col-md-6
      = link_to previous_page_usr_profile_path(profile, current_page: "skill_equipment_form"), class: "btn btn-quiet" do
        %i.bi.bi-arrow-left-circle
        Occupations
    .col-md-6.d-flex.justify-content-end.align-items-end
      %button.btn.btn-primary{ type: "submit", name: "current_page", value: "skill_equipment_form" }
        %i.bi.bi-arrow-right-circle
        Availability
